# =============================================================================
# TASK-20261008-6f12b8 -- Coordinator-only LEDGER ARCHIVE of:
#   - DEC-20261008-ef482f (validity of RA-01 to RA-03; adjudication rulings;
#     approval of the continuation);
#   - the additive protocol amendment AMD-20261008-9c080d (EXP-PFDR-0b3699
#     v1 -> v2);
#   - the cards TASK-20261008-9456e8 (continuation executor),
#     TASK-20261008-398fce (its snapshot archive) and this card, with its
#     receipt.
# Performed by the top-level session, ALONE, after check (j) of
# DEC-20261008-ef482f passes. Everything the decision rules on is already
# committed (5ea531, 5e4188), so no snapshot precedes this archive. The
# records are official only after this receipt verifies, and
# TASK-20261008-9456e8 is dispatched only after that.
# =============================================================================
handoff:
  id: TASK-20261008-6f12b8
  id_provenance: >-
    Minted by the top-level session with tools/allocate_id.py and confirmed
    free with --check, then supplied to this Coordinator. The Coordinator has
    no shell and minted no identifier.
  created_at: '2026-10-08'
  created_by: coordinator
  from: coordinator
  to: coordinator
  performed_by: the top-level session (Coordinator-only archival task; runs alone)
  status: written_not_dispatched
  archive_kind: ledger
  receipt_binding: content_at_commit
  goal_id: null
  batch_id: null
  review_plan_id: null
  experiment_id: EXP-PFDR-0b3699
  hypothesis_id: H-PFDR-2765d2
  question_id: RQ-PFDR-ae2fba
  approval_decisions: [DEC-20261008-ef482f]
  source_task_ids: [TASK-20261008-e2830e, TASK-20261008-5e4188]
  review_required: false
  title: Ledger archive of DEC-20261008-ef482f, AMD-20261008-9c080d and the cards TASK-20261008-9456e8, TASK-20261008-398fce and TASK-20261008-6f12b8
  objective: >-
    Make DEC-20261008-ef482f, protocol version 2 and the continuation cards
    official, in this order:
    - check (j) of the decision's reference_table;
    - custody of the archives the decision rules on;
    - one isolated commit of exactly the declared paths, with the receipt;
    - verify; push; refresh the PR.
  uncertainty_reduced: >-
    None scientific. This is durability, plus a mechanical confirmation that
    every value, token and hash the decision and amendment rely on holds on
    the committed tree.
  inputs:
    - ledger/decisions/DEC-20261008-ef482f.yaml, experiments/EXP-PFDR-0b3699/amendments/AMD-20261008-9c080d.yaml and the three cards (working tree)
    - coordination/design/TASK-20260928-102217/archives/TASK-20261008-5ea531/snapshot-receipt.json
    - coordination/design/TASK-20260928-102217/archives/TASK-20261008-5e4188/snapshot-receipt.json
    - coordination/design/TASK-20260928-102217/archives/TASK-20261008-733066/ledger-receipt.json
    - every file named in DEC-20261008-ef482f reference_table (read-only, for check (j))
  constraints:
    - >-
      ORDER.
      (1) Check (j): run every row of DEC-20261008-ef482f reference_table,
          read-only, per its machine_check_format, BEFORE anything is
          staged. Any MISS is a STOP: nothing is committed, and the MISS rows
          return to the Coordinator.
      (2) git diff --cached --name-only is empty.
      (3) git fetch, then merge origin/main (merge, never rebase). Record the
          base commit checked and the outcome. Re-run (j) in full if the
          merge changes a (j)-named file. A conflict inside a record is a
          STOP.
      (4) Custody: the TASK-20261008-5ea531, -5e4188, -733066, -7457ec and
          -13dfad receipts verify (content_at_commit), and every path the
          5ea531 and 5e4188 receipts bind has its path_sha256. A mismatch is
          a STOP.
      (5) Check git status, then parse, validate, hygiene and size; stage;
          commit; verify; push; refresh the PR.
    - >-
      RUN ALONE. No other archival task is running in this worktree, and no
      agent is writing any artifact_path. TASK-20261008-9456e8 has NOT been
      dispatched. Zero runs.
    - >-
      GIT STATUS. git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all shows exactly
      the five record paths this task stages, besides its receipt, and
      nothing else. Ignored __pycache__ paths do not appear in that output
      and are not a finding.
    - >-
      FAIL-FAST AND RECEIPT IN THE SAME COMMIT. Every command block runs with
      set -euo pipefail, or with an explicit exit check after every command.
      The path list comes from this card's artifact_paths, never from git
      status. The receipt is written self-neutral, parsed and staged before
      the commit, and committed in the same commit. If any step after staging
      fails, nothing is committed. Check scripts write only to absolute
      scratch paths.
    - >-
      PARSE, VALIDATE, HYGIENE, SIZE.
      - Every YAML artifact_path parses.
      - tools/validate_ledger.py reports no error naming an artifact_path.
        Record its count against origin/main's at the merged base. The three
        DEF-1 lines are recorded as known_defect_lines.
      - Every RQ-, H-, EXP- and TASK- target of DEC-20261008-ef482f
        resolves.
      - tools/check_merge_hygiene.py raises nothing naming an artifact_path.
      - Record each staged file's size.
    - >-
      STAGE ONLY the artifact_paths, one by one, with literal pathspecs; git
      add -A is forbidden. Never stage:
      - a package file, review file or hypothesis;
      - tools/run_supersession_registry.yaml or any other shared tool or
        config file (HU-4 is held for the user).
      Never edit an archived record.
    - >-
      One commit, containing the five records and the receipt. Its message
      names TASK-20261008-6f12b8, DEC-20261008-ef482f, AMD-20261008-9c080d,
      TASK-20261008-9456e8, TASK-20261008-398fce, TASK-20261008-e2830e,
      DEC-20261008-8cb005, EXP-PFDR-0b3699, H-PFDR-2765d2 and RQ-PFDR-ae2fba,
      and carries no measured value or verdict. A suitable message is
      "ledger(TASK-20261008-6f12b8): archive DEC-20261008-ef482f, protocol
      amendment AMD-20261008-9c080d and cards TASK-20261008-9456e8,
      TASK-20261008-398fce (EXP-PFDR-0b3699; H-PFDR-2765d2; RQ-PFDR-ae2fba;
      TASK-20261008-e2830e; DEC-20261008-8cb005)", followed by the session's
      attribution lines.
      Verify the receipt with tools/research_dispatch.py. Push, and refresh
      PR #2008 naming every record id. Never merge a red head.
    - >-
      DISPATCH ORDER. TASK-20261008-9456e8 is dispatched only after THIS
      receipt verifies with check (j) recorded at 0 MISS and the branch is
      pushed, and then only as its own dispatch_preconditions state.
    - Never select a provider, backend, endpoint or model identifier containing Bedrock.
  deliverables:
    - >-
      One ledger commit with exactly the artifact_paths. The receipt
      records:
      - kind ledger and binding content_at_commit;
      - record_ids;
      - check (j): script sha256, the decision's sha256 checked, per-row
        results, MISS count 0;
      - the custody results;
      - the base commit and the merge outcome;
      - the commit sha and parent (self-neutral where the verifier requires);
      - path_sha256 per staged path;
      - the parse, validate (known_defect_lines), hygiene and size results;
      - scope_findings and the verifier result.
    - the pushed branch and the refreshed PR naming every record id
  artifact_paths:
    - ledger/decisions/DEC-20261008-ef482f.yaml
    - experiments/EXP-PFDR-0b3699/amendments/AMD-20261008-9c080d.yaml
    - ledger/handoffs/TASK-20261008-9456e8.yaml
    - ledger/handoffs/TASK-20261008-398fce.yaml
    - ledger/handoffs/TASK-20261008-6f12b8.yaml
    - coordination/design/TASK-20260928-102217/archives/TASK-20261008-6f12b8/ledger-receipt.json
  receipt_path: coordination/design/TASK-20260928-102217/archives/TASK-20261008-6f12b8/ledger-receipt.json
  archived_by: TASK-20261008-6f12b8
  archived_by_note: this archival task owns its own card and receipt, committed with the records in one commit
  archive:
    kind: ledger
    source_task_ids: [TASK-20261008-e2830e, TASK-20261008-5e4188]
    record_ids:
      - DEC-20261008-ef482f
      - AMD-20261008-9c080d
      - TASK-20261008-9456e8
      - TASK-20261008-398fce
      - TASK-20261008-e2830e
      - DEC-20261008-8cb005
      - EXP-PFDR-0b3699
      - H-PFDR-2765d2
      - RQ-PFDR-ae2fba
    record_ids_note: TASK-20261008-e2830e, DEC-20261008-8cb005, EXP-PFDR-0b3699, H-PFDR-2765d2 and RQ-PFDR-ae2fba are named because the decision rules on or under them. Their files are not staged, and no status field is edited.
    binding_mode: content_at_commit
  inference:
    policy: coordinator-orchestration-code
    reasoning_effort: null
    fallback_allowed: false
    degraded_allowed: false
    independent_session_required: false
  budget:
    wall_clock_seconds: 3600
    wall_clock_note: watchdog for check (j), custody of five receipts, the merge, validation, one commit, verification and push; expiry is a checkpoint, not a result
    memory_gb: 2
    maximum_runs: 0
  completion_gate:
    - check (j) ran over every row with no MISS before anything was staged (and again after the merge if needed), and its output is in the receipt
    - the 5ea531, 5e4188, 733066, 7457ec and 13dfad receipts verify, and every bound path matches
    - every YAML artifact_path parses; validate_ledger.py reports no error naming an artifact_path; every target resolves; check_merge_hygiene.py raises nothing naming an artifact_path
    - the commit changes exactly the artifact_paths; tools/research_dispatch.py verifies the receipt on content
    - the commit message names every id in the constraints; the branch is pushed and the PR names every record id
  return_format: the check (j) summary, the custody results, the merge outcome, the commit sha, the receipt path, the verifier verdict, the validate_ledger count against the base, the hygiene result, the PR number and any scope_findings
  review_plan: null
  dispatch_preconditions:
    - archived_by bound (self).
    - The TASK-20261008-5e4188 receipt has verified and the branch is pushed.
    - No other archival task is running; TASK-20261008-9456e8 has NOT been dispatched.
  unblocks:
    - the official standing of DEC-20261008-ef482f and of EXP-PFDR-0b3699 protocol version 2
    - the dispatch of TASK-20261008-9456e8, subject to its own preconditions
  runs_launched: 0
